{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>中原地產天水圍副區域營業董事伍耀祖表示，新晉屋苑受租客追捧，天水圍YOHO West新近錄得1期2B座中層B7室租賃成交，實用面積415平方呎，屬兩房間隔，向東北，以月租1.6萬元租出，呎租38.6元。<br/>伍耀祖表示，業主於2023年12月以496.99萬元一手買入單位，租金回報3.9厘。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T10:19:35.584847+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T09:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T11:17:47.439148+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T10:17:47.120790+00:00","content_hash":"6a1b1da80e910388029b5210071ecfd7c62c7cd4a0b1751b8d4c0d094e39c104","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}